  "job_B3.2.40.6_20251003_114637": {
    "text": "Her saga\u00f0 on \u00feyssum halegum bocum be \u00e6lmihtiges dryhtnes godspelle, \u00fee he him sylfum \u00feurh his \u00f0a\n& he sylf gecw\u00e6\u00f0 his halegan mu\u00f0e: \u00feeah man anum men godspel secge, \u00feonne bio ic \u00fe\u00e6ronmiddan.\n& \u00feam bio\u00f0 synna forgifena \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6t godspel seg\u00f0 & gecwi\u00f0, & synna \u00feam bio\u00f0 forgifene \u00fee hit for\nWe \u00feonne, men \u00fea leofestan, we gehyrdon ofer secgan be \u00f0am \u00e6\u00f0elan tocyme usses dryhtnes, & hu him\n\u00de\u00e6t heahf\u00e6deras bodedon & cy\u00f0don, \u00fe\u00e6t witegan witegedon & heredon, \u00fe\u00e6t sealmscopas sungon &\n& eall \u00f0\u00e6t w\u00e6s gel\u00e6sted si\u00f0\u00f0an heofenas tohlidon & sio heahmiht on \u00feysne wang astah, & se halega\n\u00deurh \u00fea byr\u00f0ran we w\u00e6ron geh\u00e6lede, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t gebior\u00f0or we wurdon alysede, and \u00feurh \u00f0a\n& sy\u00f0\u00f0an he, dryhten Crist, her on worlde wunode mid mannum, & feala wundra mannum cy\u00f0de, &\n\u00c6r hie w\u00e6ron st\u00e6nenre heortan & blinde, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6t ongitan ne meahton \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00f0\u00e6r gehyrdon ne \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00c6r \u00fean we w\u00e6ron steopcild gewordene, \u00f0a we w\u00e6ron bewerede \u00fe\u00e6s hiofoncundan rices, & we w\u00e6ron\nW\u00e6ron we nu sy\u00f0\u00fean amearcode \u00feurh \u00feone so\u00f0an scyppend & \u00feurh \u00feone lyfigendan God & \u00feurh \u00feone\nNe gelette us \u00fe\u00e6s si\u00f0es se freca feond, ne us \u00f0\u00e6s wilweges ne forwyrne, ne us \u00fea gatu betyne \u00fee us\n& we \u00f0a dryhtenlycan w\u00e6re gehealden, & \u00fea syblycan lufan Godes and manna.\nNe syn we to gifre, ne to frece ne to fyrenlusteorne, ne to \u00e6festige, ne to inwitfulle, ne to t\u00e6lende ne to\nFor \u00f0an we a sculon bion ymbhydige ure sawle r\u00e6des, & ure hiortan reccen & gesta\u00f0eligen Gode to\nHe dem\u00f0 rihtne dom.\nNe bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r hada andfengnes mid Gode: ne bio\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r cyninga setl \u00ferymmum gefr\u00e6tewod - butan \u00feam\nAc on \u00feam gemote stande\u00f0 anra gehwylces mannes sawl.\nHio bi\u00f0 for\u00f0l\u00e6dende ealle \u00fea wiorc \u00fee hio gefremede, godes o\u00f0\u00f0e yfeles.\nGif \u00f0\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6nne bi\u00f0 \u00feara misd\u00e6dena ma & \u00fe\u00e6s godes to lyt, \u00feonne wynsuma\u00fe se wi\u00f0erwearda feond and\n& he \u00f0onne bealdlice cliopa\u00fe to \u00feam hean deman & \u00f0us cwi\u00f0.\nDem, la dema, rihtne dom & emne dom.\nDem be \u00f0am \u00fee \u00feine bebodu forhogodon, & \u00feine \u00e6 abr\u00e6con, & symle hie besmiton mid synnum &\nGearalice we witon \u00feas heregas \u00fery \u00f0e mid \u00fee w\u00e6ron - an is se heofoncunda se \u00f0e mid fere\u00f0 & \u00fee\nDem, la dryhten, rihte domas, & forl\u00e6t me mines rihtes wyrde, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e ic me sylf begiten h\u00e6bbe.\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ron mine \u00fea \u00f0e to \u00fee noldon; min right is \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fea mid witum \u00fereage \u00fea \u00fee \u00feine hyrnesse\nHie hie scyrpton minum reafum, nals \u00f0am gew\u00e6dum \u00fee \u00f0u hie hete.\nHie w\u00e6ron ungemetf\u00e6ste eallum tidum & oferhidum to fulle & mines willan to georne.\n\u00deonne hie gehyrdon \u00feine bec r\u00e6dan & \u00fein godspel secgan & hira lif rihtan & him ecne weg cy\u00f0an, hy\nAc \u00f0onne ic mine hearpan genam & mine strengas styrian ongan, hie \u00f0\u00e6t lustlice gehyrdon, & fram \u00fee\n& ic hie mine leahtras l\u00e6rde, & hie me hyrdon georne.\n& ic hie to \u00feeof\u00f0um tyhte & to geflite scyrpte & to inwitfullum ge\u00f0ancum, \u00fe\u00e6t ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t hy\nAc, hw\u00e6t, woldon hie in minon hordcofan, & \u00fein cynerice eal forgeaton.\n\u00c6t me hie leornodon scondword & lease br\u00e6gdas, & \u00feine so\u00f0f\u00e6stan lare hie forgeaton & \u00feinne dom ne\nDem, la ealra gesceafta reccend & scippend & steorend, dem rihtne dom.\nHw\u00e6t, \u00f0u \u00fee sylfne gemeddest for hyra ealra lufan & for urre l\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0o.\n\u00dein feorh for hyra in dea\u00f0 \u00feu gesealdest, & \u00feu \u00fee sylf on rode astige \u00f0\u00e6r \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fein halige blod on\n\u00dea hie to me cyrdon, n\u00e6fre ic him are ne gefremede, ne n\u00e6fre helpes geu\u00f0e; ac forl\u00e6t hie me in wite\nHw\u00e6t, we nu gehyrdon secgan, men \u00f0a leofestan, hu bealdlice sprece\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t dioful to \u00feam h\u00e6lende, &\nHe \u00feonne ofer eaxle besyh\u00f0, se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema & se rihtwisa, to \u00f0am forworhtum & to \u00f0am\n\u00de\u00e6nne bi\u00f0 dryhtnes word hra\u00fee gehyred \u00feam synfullan strengest; bi\u00f0 se dema \u00feearl.\nHabba\u00f0 we \u00fe\u00e6nne, men \u00fea leofestan, micele nyd\u00feearfe \u00fe\u00e6t we ne syn mid \u00feam scyldegum ac mid\nWe \u00f0onne sculon his mildheortnesse geearnigan, \u00fe\u00e6t we eft mildne deman h\u00e6bben.\nWe w\u00e6ron oft gemyndgode to ures dryhtnes gehyrsumnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t we scoldon his willan wyrcan & his\nNis urum h\u00e6lende nanuht behyddes ne gediglodes \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e men wyrca\u00f0 on \u00feysse worlde, for \u00fean his\nSwa sanctus Iacobus s\u00e6de, Cristes apostol, hu se h\u00e6lend spr\u00e6c to sumum welegum men \u00fee he mid\nAc he w\u00e6s ormod & swar, & him w\u00e6s la\u00f0 \u00feearfendum mannum aht to syllanne, & him w\u00e6s uny\u00f0e\nAc hyne se h\u00e6lend eft \u00feara leana myndgode, \u00f0a he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne gemundest \u00f0u na Salomones cwi\u00f0e \u00fee\nEmne hit bi\u00f0 gelice swa man mid w\u00e6tere \u00feone weallendan wylm agiote \u00fe\u00e6t he rixian ne mote, swa\n\u00deonne \u00f0u, welega, hwi noldest \u00f0u mine bebodu healdan?\nAc se min \u00feearfa asw\u00e6mde \u00e6t \u00feinre handa.\nHwi noldest \u00feu ge\u00feencan hwa hit \u00fee sealde?\n\u00deonne he cliopade earmre stemne, & \u00feu widsoce \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hiene ne gehyrdest.\nAc ic his giomrunga gehyrde & geseah hw\u00e6t \u00f0u dydest minum \u00feearfan \u00feam \u00fee \u00fee mildheortnesse\n& \u00feu hie oferhogodest & geunrotsodest & \u00feinne andwlitan fram him awendest & ne gemundest no\nSwa se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam wlancan: To hwan wurd \u00f0u swa heamul minra goda \u00fee ic \u00f0e dyde &\nTo hwan areceleasodest \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6re gife \u00fee ic \u00fee geaf?\nIc \u00fee nu afyrre fram mine sylene \u00fee ic \u00fee \u00e6r forgeaf.\n\u00deonne bist \u00f0u w\u00e6dla in woruldrice.\nFor hwan noldest \u00f0u ge\u00feencean \u00fe\u00e6t ic wille forgildan \u00e6ghwylce gode d\u00e6de \u00fee for minon naman man\nMid hundteontigum fealdum ic hit forgilde swa hit is on minon godspelle gecweden: Swa lange swa\n\u00deonne \u00f0u, man, to hwan eart \u00f0u me swa un\u00feancul minra goda & minra gifa?\nHw\u00e6t, ic \u00fee gesceop & geliff\u00e6ste, & \u00e6ghw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e \u00f0u hafast, ic \u00fee sealde.\nEall hit is min, & \u00fein ic afyrre fram \u00fee.\n\u00d0u liofa butan me gif \u00f0u m\u00e6ge.\n\u00dee ic hit sealde to \u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hit sceoldest \u00feearfum d\u00e6lan.\n& ic swerige \u00feurh me sylfne \u00fe\u00e6t ic eom se ilca God se \u00f0e weligne gedyde.\n& \u00feearfendan ic geworhte mid minum handum \u00fe\u00e6t ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u mine \u00feearfan fedde \u00feonne hie\n\u00deu him symle ti\u00f0e forwyrndest.\nFor hwan noldest \u00f0u hit ge\u00feencan, gif \u00f0u him mildheortnesse an gecy\u00f0dest, \u00feonne ne sceoldest \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6s\nTo hwan geagnedest \u00feu \u00fee anum \u00fe\u00e6t ic inc bam sealde?\nTo hwan feddest \u00f0u \u00fee \u00e6nne of \u00f0am \u00fee ic inc b\u00e6m gesceop, to welan & to feorhnere?\nTo hwan heold \u00f0u hit \u00fee sylfum & \u00feinum bearnum, \u00fe\u00e6t meahte manegum mannum genihtsumian?\nUny\u00f0e \u00fee w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hit eal ne meahtest gef\u00e6stnigan, ne mid insigelum eal beclysan.\nWenst \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t hit \u00fein sie \u00fe\u00e6t sio ear\u00f0e for\u00f0bringed, hio \u00fee growe\u00f0 & blowe\u00f0 & on lif bringe\u00f0?\nEall ic nu afyrre minne fultum fram \u00f0e.\nHafa \u00e6t \u00feinum gewinne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u m\u00e6ge & on \u00feinum geswince.\nIc ofteo mine renas \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00feine eor\u00f0an ne onhrina\u00f0, & ic afyrre fram \u00fee mine mildheortnesse, &\nGif \u00f0u wene \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fein bocland sie & on agene \u00e6ht geseald, hit \u00feonne w\u00e6ron mine w\u00e6ter \u00fea \u00f0e on\nGif \u00f0u mihta h\u00e6bbe, d\u00e6l regnas ofer \u00feine eor\u00f0an.\nGif \u00f0u strang sy, syle w\u00e6stm \u00feinre eor\u00f0an.\nIc ahyrde mine sunnan & hie gebyrhte; \u00feone forb\u00e6rne\u00f0 hio ealle \u00feine \u00e6ceras.\n\u00deonne bist \u00f0u d\u00e6lleas mines renes, & \u00fee \u00fein eor\u00f0e bi\u00f0 idel & unnyt goda gehwylces.\nMine \u00feearfan lifia\u00f0 bi me.\nGif \u00f0u m\u00e6ge, wuna butan me.\nMine \u00feearfan me ealne weg habba\u00f0, & ic hie n\u00e6fre ne forl\u00e6te.\nMine \u00feearfan ne lufia\u00f0, & hie cygea\u00f0 me hyra dryhten - & hine gelomlice nemna\u00fe & lufia\u00f0, & him\n\u00deonne \u00feu, welega, ne \u00feu \u00feinne dryhten lufast, ne \u00f0u him miltse \u00e6t hafast, ne \u00f0u, yrming, ne most lifian\nHw\u00e6t, wendest \u00f0u, wlanca, gif \u00f0u me sealde \u00feines awiht \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee \u00feonne w\u00e6re \u00fein woruldgestreon a\nEala, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u lyt hogodest ymb \u00feone ende \u00feines lifes.\nTo dol \u00f0u w\u00e6re, \u00fea \u00f0u wendest \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feinra feohgestreona ende ne wurde.\nIc wat, hw\u00e6\u00f0re, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fein lif bi\u00f0 geendod \u00feonne \u00f0u his ne wenst.\n\u00deu, welega, to hwan getruwedest \u00f0u in \u00feine wlenceo & in \u00feine oferflownessa \u00feinra goda, & na on me\n& he \u00f0a, dryhten Crist, cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0am welegan men: Eawla, \u00f0u, dysega & gedwealda, to hwy\n\u00dein sawl on \u00feisse ilcan niht bi\u00f0 be minre h\u00e6se of \u00f0inum lichoman al\u00e6ded.\nAc hwa feh\u00f0 \u00feonne to \u00feam \u00fee \u00feu lange stryndest?\nO\u00f0\u00f0e hwam gearwodest \u00feu \u00fein botl o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feine getimbro, nu \u00feine yrfeweardas leng lyfian ne moton, for\nMen \u00fea leofestan, sceoldon \u00fea word bion ealle cu\u00f0lice gel\u00e6ste \u00fee se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0.\nSona \u00fea on \u00feone welegan mannon on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan nihte d\u00e6\u00fe on becwom, & on his bearn ealle.\nFengon \u00fea to gestreonum fremde sy\u00fe\u00fean.\nHw\u00e6t, we nu magon be \u00feysan ongitan & oncnawan \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6lmihtiga God nele \u00fe\u00e6t his gifena man\nNe \u00f0urfon we \u00fe\u00e6s wenan \u00fe\u00e6t he us nelle \u00feara leana gemanigan \u00fee he us her on eor\u00f0an to gode\nEmne swa he us m\u00e6rlycor gife\u00f0, wa we him m\u00e6rlycor \u00feancian sculon, a swa \u00ferymlycor ar swa mare\n\u00deam \u00fee dryhten mycel to forl\u00e6te\u00f0, myceles he hine eac eft mana\u00f0.\n\u00deam \u00fee he micel syle\u00f0, mycel he to \u00feam sece\u00f0.\n\u00c6ghwylc heah ham her in worulde bi\u00f0 mid frecennesse ymbseald.\nEmne swa \u00f0a woruldge\u00feingu bio\u00f0 maran, swa bio\u00f0 \u00fea frecennessa swi\u00f0ran.\nSwa ge magon bi \u00f0an \u00fea bysene oncnawan & ongitan: \u00fe\u00e6t treow, \u00feonne hit geweaxe\u00f0 on \u00f0am\nSwa bi\u00f0 eac gelic be \u00f0am hean clifum & torrum, \u00feonne hie feorran ofer \u00f0a o\u00f0re eor\u00fean hlifia\u00f0, & hie\nSwylce eac be \u00f0am micelum muntum & dunum, \u00fea \u00fee hyhst standa\u00fe & goria\u00f0 ofer ealne\nSwa \u00f0a hean myhta her in worulde hreosa\u00fe & fealla\u00f0 & to lore wior\u00f0, \u00feysse worulde welan wior\u00f0 to\n\u00deeah we \u00feysse worulde glenga tiligen swi\u00f0e & we in wuldre scinan swi\u00f0e, & \u00feeah we us scyrpen mid\n& \u00feeah \u00fea strengestan & \u00fea ricestan hatan him reste gewyrcan of marmanstane & of o\u00f0rum\n\u00deonne bi\u00f0 sio gleng agoten, & se \u00ferym tobroden, & \u00fea gimmas toglidene, & \u00fe\u00e6t gold tosc\u00e6ned, & \u00fea\nFor \u00fean nis naht \u00feysses middangeardes wlite & \u00feysse worulde wela; he is hwilendlic & yfellic &\nHw\u00e6r syndon \u00fea rican caseras & cyningas \u00fea \u00fee gio w\u00e6ron, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fea cyningas \u00fee we io cu\u00f0on?\nHw\u00e6r syndon \u00fea ealdormen \u00fea \u00fee bebodu setton?\nHw\u00e6r is demera domstow?\nHw\u00e6r is hira ofermetto, butan mid moldan be\u00feeahte & in witu gecyrred?\nWa is worulde scriftum, butan hie mid rihte reccen.\nNis \u00feam leornerum na sel \u00feonne leornendum, butan hie mid rihte domas secen.\nHw\u00e6r coman middangeardes gestreon?\nHw\u00e6r com worulde wela?\nHw\u00e6r cwom foldan f\u00e6gernes?\nHw\u00e6r coman \u00fea \u00fee geornlicost \u00e6hta tiledon & o\u00f0rum eft yrfe l\u00e6fdon?\nSwa l\u00e6ne is sio oferlufu eor\u00f0angestreona, emne hit bi\u00f0 gelice rena scurum, \u00feonne he of heofenum\nSwa tealte syndon eor\u00f0an dreamas, & swa tod\u00e6le\u00f0 lic & sawle.\n\u00deonne is us uncu\u00f0 hu se dema ymb \u00fe\u00e6t gedon wylle.\nFor \u00fean nis naht ne selre \u00feonne we lufigen urne dryhten mid ealle mode, & mid ealle m\u00e6gene, & ofer\nSwa hit awriten is, & he sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0: Se \u00f0e h\u00e6f\u00f0 minne lufan in him & his bene to me sende\u00f0, ic hine\n& \u00fea \u00fee to me cyrra\u00fe fram hyra gyltum, & geandetta\u00fe on minum naman, & bote mid f\u00e6stenum do\u00f0 &\nFor \u00feam ior\u00f0licum ic sylle \u00fea heofonlican, for \u00feyssum willendlicum \u00fea ecan, for \u00feyssum l\u00e6nan life\nGes\u00e6lige bio\u00f0 \u00fea \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t rice gemuna\u00f0: unl\u00e6de bio\u00f0 \u00fea \u00fee \u00feam wi\u00f0saca\u00fe.\nHw\u00e6t hylpe\u00f0 \u00feam men aht, \u00feeah \u00fee he ealne middangeard on his anes \u00e6ht eal gestryne, gif eft \u00fe\u00e6t\nNe him no \u00fee bet ne bi\u00f0, \u00feeah he her on life lifige \u00feusend wintra, gif he \u00e6fter his dea\u00fee bi\u00f0 l\u00e6ded on\nUtan we \u00fe\u00e6nne wendan to \u00feam beteran & gecyrran to \u00feam selran.\n\u00deonne we moton gesion so\u00f0ne gefean, & on gefean faran to f\u00e6der rice.\n\u00de\u00e6r is sio hea ar, & \u00fe\u00e6r is sio fr\u00e6tewednes \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elinges.\n\u00de\u00e6r is cyninges \u00ferym gesyne, & \u00fe\u00e6r is arwyr\u00f0nes witegna.\n& \u00fe\u00e6r is gest\u00e6\u00f0\u00feignes giogu\u00f0e & \u00fe\u00e6r is ar & f\u00e6gernes werum & wifum, & gesw\u00e6sscipe engla, &\n\u00de\u00e6r is sang & swinsung & Go\u00f0es lof gehyred, & \u00fe\u00e6s hyhstan cyninges gehyrnes, & sio biorhtu \u00feara\n& we syndon \u00feyder gela\u00f0ode & gehatene to \u00fean halegan ham & to \u00feam cynelycan fri\u00f0stole \u00fe\u00e6r",
